{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27075","headline":"同朱庆余宿翊西上人房 · 周贺","name":"同朱庆余宿翊西上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪僧还共谒，相与坐寒天。\n屋雪凌高烛，山茶称远泉。\n夜清更彻寺，空阔雁冲烟。\n莫怪多时话，重来又隔年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}